Package: fessel-monitor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-gi, gir1.2-gst-plugins-bad-1.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-tools, mosquitto, v4l-utils
Maintainer: Fessel <noreply@example.com>
Description: Fessel robot-arm monitoring (Pi side)
 supervisor (safety/control plane + MQTT relay) and video (GStreamer
 pipeline + live state machine), installed as system-site-packages venvs
 with their systemd units and seeded /etc/fessel config.
